@startuml
title Order fulfilment - Business flow
|Customer|
start
:Place order;
|System|
:Validate order;
if (Stock available?) then (yes)
  :Reserve stock;
  :Request payment;
  if (Paid?) then (yes)
    |Warehouse|
    :Pick and pack;
    :Ship;
    |System|
    :Send tracking email;
  else (no)
    :Release stock;
    :Notify customer;
  endif
else (no)
  :Notify out of stock;
endif
stop
@enduml
